{'symbol': 'HST', 'date': '2021-05-04 16:30:00', 'title': 'HOST HOTELS & RESORTS, INC. ACQUIRES FOUR SEASONS RESORT ORLANDO AT WALT DISNEY WORLD® RESORT FOR $610 MILLION', 'text': "BETHESDA, MD., MAY 04, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HOST HOTELS\xa0& RESORTS, INC. (NASDAQ: HST) (THE “COMPANY”), THE NATION'S LARGEST LODGING REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST (“REIT”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ACQUIRED THE FEE SIMPLE INTEREST IN THE 444-ROOM FOUR SEASONS RESORT ORLANDO AT WALT DISNEY WORLD® RESORT FOR APPROXIMATELY $610 MILLION IN CASH."}